Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before doing any work in this repo. It is the canonical spec for
the search-to-apply pipeline and wins over any other instructions here.

Tooling: Playwright MCP via `.mcp.json` for browser navigation and web-form applications (see
`BROWSER-TOOLING.md`); web fetch/search for `feed` and `ats` sources; a configured Gmail/SMTP integration
for email applications. Copy identity fields verbatim from `config/identity.json`, verify the resume
attached before submitting, honor `PAUSE` and `dryRun`, and log every attempt to
`data/applications.jsonl`.
